      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That curtain and flashes are classic signs of retinal detachment, which is a medical emergency, not just stress or screen strain. You need to stop using your phone immediately and go to an ER or call an ambulance right now; do not wait for eye drops to work. If you don't get treated within hours, you could lose that eye permanently.",
