      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Stop taking those supplements immediately; high doses of Vitamin A can actually cause liver damage and worsen your vision.\nThat shadow is a retinal detachment, not a vitamin deficiency, and no amount of supplements will pull a torn retina back together.\nYou need to go to the ER right now, even if you have no money, because losing your eye is far worse than any medical bill you could face.",
